@startuml

|User|
start
:Ask:
"Which books are overdue
in Central Library?";

|Langflow Agent|
:Select tool
get_overdue_loans(
library=LIBRARY_NAME
);

|FastMCP Server|
:Validate / resolve parameters;
:Instantiate SPARQL template;

|GraphDB|
:Execute CONSTRUCT query;

|FastMCP Server|
:Parse SPARQL results;
:Transform results into
tool response;

|Langflow Agent|
:Interpret tool result;
:Generate natural-language answer;

|User|
:Receive answer;
stop

@enduml